      <rules>
        <rule id="a344-a227-7394-9c3c" name="Reference coverage" hidden="false">
          <description>Summaries use printed book page numbers, not PDF viewer page numbers. Unit abilities and equipment rules also appear with the relevant selections. Effects and temporary characteristic changes are descriptive and are applied during play. Spell deck profiles are reference lists, not granted spells. See COVERAGE.md for gaps and manual checks.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="2b80-a29b-f296-ce00" name="Army percentage warning" hidden="false">
          <description>Live v0.2 testing showed the app using points spent as the percentage basis and displaying champion points in both their regiment category and Characters. These percentage checks remain provisional in v0.5; calculate legal army allowances against the agreed points limit manually.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="7a78-a0d4-db52-7e83" name="Where to find special characters" hidden="false">
          <description>Louen Leoncoeur, the Lionhearted — Characters; Repanse de Lyonesse — Characters; Baron Odo of Outremer with Suliman le Saracen — champion in Knights Errant, Knights of the Realm; Roland le Marechal — champion in Knights Errant, Knights of the Realm; Tancred, Duc de Quenelles — Characters; Bertrand the Brigand with Hugo le Petit and Gui le Gros — champion in Bowmen; Knight of the Perilous Lance — Characters; Tristan le Troubadour with Jules le Jongleur — Characters; Reynard le Chasseur with Groffe and Griffe — champion in Knights Errant, Knights of the Realm, Mounted Squires; Armand d’Aquitaine — Characters; Jasperre le Beau, Dragonslayer — Characters; Bohemond Beastslayer, Duke of Bastonne — Characters; The Green Knight — Characters; Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress — Characters.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
