        </rule>
        <rule id="8cf0-4c2c-3e57-96f7" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Heavy armour; shield; Morning Star of Fracasse.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="a0ba-2300-0c93-32c6" name="Suliman" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="69">
          <description>Included with Odo. Light armour, shield and a double-handed scimitar usable mounted. They move and fight together and use Odo’s Leadership while he lives. An enemy fighting Suliman tests Leadership; failure lets Suliman strike first regardless of charges, Initiative or magic weapons. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 69.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
