        <profile id="69e2-5441-66ab-4730" name="Roland’s Warhorn" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="69–70">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Bound spell</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">Once in each own magic phase, without Power. Enemy flyers within 18 inches immediately fly high and remain there until passing Leadership at the start of their turn. While high they cannot attack Bretonnian flyers, although those flyers may attack them.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 69–70. Card value 25 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
