        <profile id="bf4b-8025-77ae-283c" name="Black Arrow" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="71">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Magic weapon</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">One use. If it hits, it wounds automatically; only magical armour can save.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 71. Card value 5 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="7f45-0a04-cbe3-5bf9" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
        <constraint id="51d2-f453-e11e-a5e4" type="max" value="1" scope="roster" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="2321-4bcd-e23c-0ca3" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 83 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="afee-5a9b-3d7e-15e2" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Sword; longbow; Black Arrow.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="8b20-500d-5047-6d6b" name="Bowmen of Bergerac" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="71">
          <description>The three named models cost 83 Characters points together. Other Bowmen cost +1 point each and cannot buy armour. The unit may skirmish or use the Arrowhead formation; normal standard and musician options remain. Bertrand may re-roll his bow To Hit roll. Hugo carries an enormous longbow whose hits have Strength 5. Gui has the normal Bowmen profile and equipment. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 71.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0cc1-14c5-7cdc-fc9e" name="Gui’s wine" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="71">
          <description>One use at the start of any turn. The unit becomes immune to Panic for the rest of the battle, but suffers -1 to shooting To Hit for the same duration. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 71.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="61da-a28a-8883-b541" name="Longbow" targetId="09fd-4e2f-b4dd-7a71" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="56" />
        <infoLink id="f43a-c12c-8fce-9e08" name="Champions, characters and challenges" targetId="c172-7f3e-b5a2-05ea" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="59–67" />
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
