        <rule id="862f-dba9-97cc-7a4c" name="Perilous Lance and Parrying Shield" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="71–72">
          <description>While charging, opponents suffer an extra -1 to armour saves against his lance. He may re-roll failed armour saves against hand-to-hand attacks. These are skills, not magic items. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 71–72.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
