      <rules>
        <rule id="b5b0-a812-efff-6f09" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 90 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="5b2a-f053-c36c-e2f5" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Sword; boar spear; heavy armour; shield.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="9560-e04d-993d-e9bf" name="Boar spear" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="73">
          <description>Normal mounted spear bonus (+1 Strength on the charge). An opponent wounded by it loses D6 Attacks that turn; useful only if Reynard strikes before that opponent. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 73.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="37ea-de1b-18f5-26bb" name="Hounds and hawk" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="73">
          <description>The hounds stay with Reynard, using his Leadership. If he dies they move together using the Scatter die, attacking enemies they touch. If both hounds die Reynard hates the enemy. His hawk’s extra attack is already included in his profile. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 73.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="bb08-4f29-fdac-faa3" name="Mounted Squires" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="73">
          <description>If Reynard leads Mounted Squires they gain the Knight’s Virtue and ignore Panic caused by fleeing non-Knights. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 73.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="b3e5-0528-7dc6-4cc6" name="Knight's Virtue" targetId="0208-dc69-3c50-3b5e" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="48" />
        <infoLink id="069b-ae16-c513-9d95" name="Armour, shield and barding" targetId="1d9b-1051-0031-be6d" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="15, 30, 37" />
