      <rules>
        <rule id="cca4-784d-a39c-e6fe" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 170 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="49d4-f4ca-d372-6d34" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Heavy armour; shield; Dolorous Blade; barded warhorse (2+ armour save).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="63fe-7b94-7450-0749" name="Hermit Knight" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="76">
          <description>Cannot join units. Deploy normally or outside the enemy deployment zone within 6 inches of a suitable sacred terrain feature. The detailed rule allows movement anywhere after the battle begins; this is followed despite the introductory sentence saying he cannot leave his feature. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 76.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fc01-be65-9f1a-f1da" name="Supernatural protection" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="76">
          <description>Immune to psychology. Natural dispel 2+. At the end of a close-combat phase, regenerate his lost wound on 2+. On failure he flees directly to his terrain feature, disappears and cannot rally; friendly troops treat him as fleeing for Panic. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 76.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="359d-b6d3-1ff6-550f" name="Fear" targetId="7c4f-53c7-b87a-c8ff" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="48–49" />
        <infoLink id="c575-3019-9673-656e" name="Armour, shield and barding" targetId="1d9b-1051-0031-be6d" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="15, 30, 37" />
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="8281-9bf4-d07b-3def" name="Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="0044-15f1-782b-00ea" value="429" />
      </costs>
