        <categoryLink id="031d-484e-06e6-b13c" name="Characters" targetId="0114-02b1-a20d-82f1" primary="true" hidden="false" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="cbda-7f84-807c-50d7" name="Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress" typeId="e25d-f63f-8d67-4bda" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="df0b-cf43-1955-6845">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="c83c-b081-d246-d5ef">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="960a-0c90-a448-96b4">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="639b-d234-7e46-084b">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="6a8e-5ca4-9d4e-d596">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="8a8d-ce29-476c-e0fa">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="946e-86c4-ffce-c3ed">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="4cc5-d3f5-26a7-37c2">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="cedc-6339-9f57-49bd">9</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="9a4a-c244-3522-1225" name="Unicorn" typeId="e25d-f63f-8d67-4bda" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="df0b-cf43-1955-6845">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="c83c-b081-d246-d5ef">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="960a-0c90-a448-96b4">0</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="639b-d234-7e46-084b">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="6a8e-5ca4-9d4e-d596">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="8a8d-ce29-476c-e0fa">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="946e-86c4-ffce-c3ed">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="4cc5-d3f5-26a7-37c2">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="cedc-6339-9f57-49bd">9</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="fb11-c021-d301-fe38" name="Chalice of Potions" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="80">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Enchanted item</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">Choose a colour before battle. Drink once at the start of an own turn; effect lasts, rolling at each later own turn start and expiring on 1. Red: Morgiana and touching friends ignore their first wound each turn. Yellow: touching enemies need 6 to hit any opponent. White: her unit cannot be targeted by missiles. Violet: each touching enemy rolls D6 at combat start and dies if above Toughness. Blue: nominate one enemy war machine; it cannot shoot and attempts misfire if it has a misfire chart.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 80. Card value 40 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="8765-6e0a-4fae-5e77" name="Morgiana’s Mirror" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="80">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Wizard arcana</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">One use before battle to inspect one enemy wizard’s spells. Also +1 to Morgiana’s Mental Duel rolls throughout the battle.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 80. Card value 10 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="523a-11ef-1d1c-ae43" name="Toad Power Familiar" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="80">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Wizard arcana</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">Invulnerable companion granting one extra Winds of Magic card each magic phase. It leaves if Morgiana is killed.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 80. Card value 30 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="195a-68ba-5562-b677" name="Girdle of Gold" typeId="b93a-4f1c-9871-3028" typeName="Magic item" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="80">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="7ef9-9797-693d-d937">Ward</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d277-fc43-48d0-6dce">Special save 4+ against wounds, except wounds inflicted by a Knight breaking the ban.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="2fa3-15cf-fc7d-e42b">Bretonnia, printed p. 80. Card value 60 points, included in the character total.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="23f7-abf1-238e-1daa">Book-checked summary; fixed loadout</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="67e1-c25f-40f8-270a" name="Spiteful Glance" typeId="9449-4f21-0583-ddfa" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Lore" typeId="d783-9c87-2677-5247">Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress — unique spell</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Power" typeId="4906-4226-3bc0-8c0f">1+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6f86-de4c-df8c-d65e">D6 inches per Power card</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d107-f119-4175-3647">One visible enemy character becomes a frog; no resistance beyond countering the spell. It cannot act, cast or counter magic, be attacked or harmed. It yields no victory points. A ridden monster takes a reaction test.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Duration" typeId="bcd5-9122-20dc-efc3">Resolve as described</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="3d00-247e-9cd5-be21">Bretonnia, printed p. 81</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="a8d4-be7a-bb66-130e">Included unique spell</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="596f-ddbf-f453-6c9c" name="Mist of Chalons" typeId="9449-4f21-0583-ddfa" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Lore" typeId="d783-9c87-2677-5247">Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress — unique spell</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Power" typeId="4906-4226-3bc0-8c0f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6f86-de4c-df8c-d65e">24 inches</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d107-f119-4175-3647">One unit cannot shoot or be shot at, cannot march, and enemies suffer -1 To Hit it in melee. It may move and charge. Remains in play.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Duration" typeId="bcd5-9122-20dc-efc3">Resolve as described</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="3d00-247e-9cd5-be21">Bretonnia, printed p. 81</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="a8d4-be7a-bb66-130e">Included unique spell</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="e320-253f-013e-8dc2" name="Doom of Dol" typeId="9449-4f21-0583-ddfa" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Lore" typeId="d783-9c87-2677-5247">Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress — unique spell</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Power" typeId="4906-4226-3bc0-8c0f">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6f86-de4c-df8c-d65e">Not specified</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d107-f119-4175-3647">Choose an enemy character or monster and a friendly Bretonnian character. The friend has Strength 10 against that enemy. Remains in play; cannot recast while active. If the target kills the chosen friend the spell is permanently lost.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Duration" typeId="bcd5-9122-20dc-efc3">Resolve as described</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="3d00-247e-9cd5-be21">Bretonnia, printed p. 81</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="a8d4-be7a-bb66-130e">Included unique spell</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="8bd8-b639-3a03-62d0" name="Beguilement of Blondel" typeId="9449-4f21-0583-ddfa" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="81">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Lore" typeId="d783-9c87-2677-5247">Morgiana le Fay, Fay Enchantress — unique spell</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Power" typeId="4906-4226-3bc0-8c0f">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6f86-de4c-df8c-d65e">24 inches</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="d107-f119-4175-3647">An enemy unit cannot act in its next turn unless it passes a Leadership test. Lasts one turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Duration" typeId="bcd5-9122-20dc-efc3">Resolve as described</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Reference" typeId="3d00-247e-9cd5-be21">Bretonnia, printed p. 81</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Coverage" typeId="a8d4-be7a-bb66-130e">Included unique spell</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="301b-e421-f7a7-db92" type="max" value="1" scope="parent" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
        <constraint id="de0a-d715-6d6d-d8bf" type="max" value="1" scope="roster" field="selections" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="3b3b-51f2-cbcc-2fdc" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 429 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="20c4-c78f-9f0e-b328" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Sword; Unicorn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="7c2e-8f5b-9bae-d8d2" name="Favours of the Fay" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <description>After deployment before turn one, ordinary Knight characters may seek a favour: Errant champions automatically; other champions on 4+, Heroes 5+, Lords 6. Special characters cannot receive favours. One favour per Knight and each favour once per army. Record successful favours in roster notes. Refusing a challenge (unless another pledged Knight accepts) or fleeing breaks the ban: that Knight and Morgiana each suffer one wound with no saves. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 78–81.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="79c7-ed29-f2b5-8506" name="Slaying favours" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <description>Daemon, Dragon, Undead or Wizard Slaying: after wounding the corresponding foe in melee roll D6; 2–5 inflicts D6 further wounds; 6 slays it. Daemon Slaying allows no armour or daemonic save, Dragon Slaying no scaly-skin save, and Undead/Wizard Slaying no saves of any kind. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 78–81.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="7ed4-be86-6c92-b3a6" name="Other favours" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <description>Fortune: re-roll one To Hit, To Wound or save die per combat phase. Justice: an opponent’s magic weapon becomes mundane if the Knight has no magic weapon or that opponent’s weapon costs more. Bravery: must issue challenges; an accepted challenge gives +1 To Hit and +1 Strength that turn. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 78–81.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ff83-aa38-4044-beb5" name="Defenders of the Fay" hidden="false" publicationId="ef30-8d5f-80e5-af93" page="78–81">
          <description>A Knights Errant unit with Morgiana cannot break in combat. If she dies with them, survivors hate the enemy. Her Unicorn gains +2 Strength charging, gives a 4+ natural dispel to her/unit, and its attacks negate daemonic saves. Reference: Bretonnia, printed p. 78–81.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fd5a-639b-3082-fb5b" name="Magic and spell allocation" hidden="false">
          <description>Magic level 4; 4 spells. Printed spell count already includes fixed bloodline effects; do not add those bonuses again. Uses the four unique spells printed below.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="317a-9b0f-6990-c653" name="Unicorn abilities" targetId="2e3d-6bef-ca5b-5233" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="53" />
        <infoLink id="0c4c-09b4-83e8-d722" name="Ridden monsters and rider loss" targetId="70ef-ea27-1ae3-36d7" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="68–70" />
        <infoLink id="ff73-c3ca-c824-4959" name="Magic phase and Winds of Magic" targetId="51af-8134-e1d0-5c8f" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="7f78-0cdc-b6a0-484e" page="9–12" />
        <infoLink id="dc95-9c4a-8914-e4a1" name="Counter magic and natural dispels" targetId="a2e7-268a-edde-1495" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="7f78-0cdc-b6a0-484e" page="10–14" />
        <infoLink id="fc2a-0069-06db-846f" name="Winds of Magic special cards" targetId="0d22-3d38-e047-8557" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="7f78-0cdc-b6a0-484e" page="9–10" />
        <infoLink id="92b5-a821-fa45-8a54" name="Spells remaining in play" targetId="b403-7328-b3ca-4dd7" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="7f78-0cdc-b6a0-484e" page="11–14" />
        <infoLink id="79ea-c739-7517-ebf9" name="Spell targets, sight and templates" targetId="34de-d976-f1cf-5402" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="7f78-0cdc-b6a0-484e" page="12, 22" />
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
  </sharedSelectionEntries>
